<title>UK: Grand gains as LVMH ups stake - dealers.</title>
<headline>Grand gains as LVMH ups stake - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Grand Metropolitan Plc shot higher in heavy trade late Thursday as France's LVMH increased its stake in the UK food and drinks group, dealers said</p>
<p>Grand Met shares were up 20-1/2p to 606-1/2 by 1515 GMT in volume of over 250 million shares, making it the most active stock in the UK market by a substantial margin.</p>
</text>
